  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "From outside, heaven form circles an ordinary looking spot that seems to be made of air. Inner scenery shows a huge population, larger than Lang Ya blessed land’s hairy men, a unique cultivation style, and a good number of Gu Immortals. The grotto-heaven mainly has information path dao marks, so its environment produces information path resources, and the Gu Masters and Gu Immortals here mainly cultivate that path. Isolated from the outside world for many years, it annexed an immemorial nine heavens fragment, and its heavenly spirit is muddle-headed. The original owner’s immortal killer move Assisting Literary Talents remains effective: a purebred human who creates or recites outstanding poems or writings gains recognition and reward. Mortals can awaken an aperture by attracting hope Gu. Gu Masters can obtain Gu worms or raise cultivation. Fang Yuan cannot annex it.",
      "chapters": [
        1684
      ],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_lang_ya_blessed_land",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "fac_gu_masters",
        "gu_hope_gu",
        "sys_gu_worms",
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "A white-robed old man with rank eight aura, resembling a scholar, destroys heaven form’s white light from the sky and again from underground. Information path specializes in detection, gathering intel, and spreading news. Fixed Immortal Travel also fails to get Fang Yuan inside. He leaves knowing the position. After annexing a nine heavens fragment, the grotto-heaven cannot be moved.",
      "chapters": [
        1684
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "path_information",
        "gu_fixed_immortal_travel"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Granny Skeleton names Old Immortal Hua Yu as a rank eight Gu Immortal who controls Profound Literature grotto-heaven, with quite the reputation in Eastern Sea’s white heaven. An Chong goes to immemorial white heaven and is invited in. Old Immortal Hua Yu says the grotto-heaven does not involve itself in worldly affairs and is a neutral party, with little interest in an alliance, though they can still exchange resources.",
      "chapters": [
        1975
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "rank-eight-controller",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_granny_skeleton",
        "char_old_immortal_hua_yu",
        "reg_eastern_sea",
        "char_an_chong"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When Wu Shuai asks which grotto-heaven is suitable, the one mentioned most is Profound Literature grotto-heaven. Old Immortal Hua Yu is a human with powerful strength and high prestige among surrounding grotto-heaven forces. Getting rid of him and incorporating the grotto-heaven into the two heavens alliance would have countless benefits.",
      "chapters": [
        2007
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "most-suitable-target",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_wu_shuai"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Profound Literature grotto-heaven is in the Righteous Qi Alliance. Most of the contents of its information path true inheritance can be obtained through internal exchange between Righteous Qi Alliance members.",
      "chapters": [
        2081
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "righteous-qi-alliance",
